{"nodes": [{"id": "reference_images_reference_live_mobile_live_mobile_ground_truth", "label": "Live Wix Site - Mobile Ground Truth @390px", "file_type": "image", "source_file": "reference-images/reference_live_mobile.png", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Declared mobile ground truth at 390px. Confirms the ticker really is a red/orange gradient with white text on mobile too. Shows single-column stacked Board cards, stacked Step 1 / Step 2 white cards separated by a red rule, the yellow chapter band is NOT present (heading and photo sit on plain background), the hero display wordmark did not render in this capture, the envelope icon bleeds across the Application Steps block boundary, a Wix sticky nav overlay appears mid-scroll, and the footer reads '(c) 2024 by OWGT' - conflicting with the 2025 seen on the desktop live capture. Dimensions 390x5074."}, {"id": "mobile_layout_390", "label": "Mobile Layout @390px", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "reference-images/reference_live_mobile.png", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Canonical target viewport. Everything collapses to a single full-width column with reduced padding; section headers stack heading-above-copy; step cards and board cards become full-width vertical stacks; a compact sticky nav (logotype + Join pill + hamburger) replaces the desktop nav row."}, {"id": "mobile_sticky_nav_overlay", "label": "Mobile Sticky Nav Overlay (Wix Runtime)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "reference-images/reference_live_mobile.png", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Scroll-triggered compact bar (logotype, red 'Join' pill, hamburger) that appears partway down the mobile page, captured in place. Wix-runtime scroll affordance; the static rebuild likely needs a CSS-sticky equivalent."}, {"id": "discrepancy_mobile_hero_headline_absent", "label": "Discrepancy: Mobile Hero Headline Not Rendered in Live Mobile Capture", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "reference-images/reference_live_mobile.png", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The 390px live capture shows the pastel hero background but no 'OneWorld GreaterTogether' wordmark and no scroll cue, while the same hero renders fully at 1280px and 1440px. Either the live site genuinely drops the headline on mobile, or the capture fired before Wix finished hydrating that text. Do not delete the mobile hero on the strength of this image alone - verify against the live URL first."}, {"id": "discrepancy_mobile_yellow_band_absent", "label": "Discrepancy: Chapter Yellow Band Absent on Mobile", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "reference-images/reference_live_mobile.png", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The 'How to start a chapter?' heading and its photo appear on the plain page background at 390px, with the saturated yellow band present at 1280px and 1440px. If genuine, this is an intentional mobile simplification the rebuild must match rather than a Wix bug to copy everywhere."}, {"id": "ambiguity_mobile_envelope_icon_overlap", "label": "Ambiguity: Envelope Icon Bleeds Across Section Boundary on Mobile", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "reference-images/reference_live_mobile.png", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "At 390px the pixel-art envelope sits on the Application Steps block edge, overlapping both the orange fill and the page background and colliding with the 'Application Steps' heading. Could be a deliberate layered sticker effect or a responsive-positioning bug on the Wix side; the reference is authoritative either way, so the rebuild should reproduce the overlap rather than clean it up."}], "edges": [{"source": "reference_images_reference_live_mobile_live_mobile_ground_truth", "target": "announcement_ticker_band", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "reference-images/reference_live_mobile.png", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "reference_images_reference_live_mobile_live_mobile_ground_truth", "target": "sticky_header_nav", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "reference-images/reference_live_mobile.png", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "reference_images_reference_live_mobile_live_mobile_ground_truth", "target": "mobile_sticky_nav_overlay", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "reference-images/reference_live_mobile.png", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "reference_images_reference_live_mobile_live_mobile_ground_truth", "target": "volunteer_cta_section", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "reference-images/reference_live_mobile.png", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "reference_images_reference_live_mobile_live_mobile_ground_truth", "target": "application_steps_block", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "reference-images/reference_live_mobile.png", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "reference_images_reference_live_mobile_live_mobile_ground_truth", "target": "board_sticky_scroll_section", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "reference-images/reference_live_mobile.png", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "reference_images_reference_live_mobile_live_mobile_ground_truth", "target": "board_member_card", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EX